      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can image one of two things may have happened:\n\n- The world you switched to had a custom loading screen. (This is usually only shown in desktop mode.)\n\n- An user-created avatar was unpacked and played a screenspace FX animation.\n\nThere doesn't seem to be a bug here, no output logs to diagnose. In other words, this seems to be normal behavior as designed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
